{"resourceIdentifier":"2763","resourceName":"Waste Energy project in Dadra & Nagar Haveli(D&NH)","description":"3R Management (P) Ltd (hereafter referred as “project proponent”) is installing Composting at various locations across India as a grouped project activity. 3R Management (P) Ltd is looking forward to earn carbon credits under VCS mechanism for these composting projects\r\nComposting is a process by which organic wastes are broken down by microorganisms, generally bacteria and fungi, into simpler forms. The microorganisms use the carbon in the waste as an energy source. The degradation of the nitrogen- containing materials results in the breakdown of the original materials into a much more uniform product which can be used as a soil amendment. Heat generated during the process kills many unwanted organisms such as weed seeds and pathogens. Advantages of composting include reduction of waste volume, elimination of heat-killed pests, and the generation of a beneficial and marketable material. Adding compost to soil increases organic matter content.","location":{"latitude":20.140000,"longitude":72.570000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-04-21","endExclusive":"2022-05-22","endInclusive":"2022-05-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2763"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3R Management (P) Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"New Delhi, India"},{"type":"string","value":"info@3RM.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"90808"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technolo